{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108250","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108250/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108250/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108250/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108250","id":3200484828,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6dU8kY","number":108250,"title":"Ensure `Projection`'s getters have uniform behavior with y_flip and reverse_z","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-03T19:52:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T09:20:22Z","closed_at":"2026-02-15T17:03:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108250","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108250","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108250.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108250.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR partially solves #106312 and #107383 by ensuring that `Projection`'s getters return the same values even when `y_flip` and/or `reverse_z` are applied.\r\nHowever I couldn't find a way to support `remap_z` without disruption, which makes this PR of little help with Vulkan-style matrices Z ∈ [0; 1] (for instance with Forward+).\r\n\r\nThe fundamental issue is that #100209 only supports OpenGL-style matrices (negative Z-facing, Z ∈ [-1; 1], and Y upwards), which seemed reasonable considering all user-facing code follows this standard. This is not necessarily true in the buffers though, nor inside the callbacks of the Compositor.\r\n\r\nI leave this PR in draft state so that whoever can take a look and share ideas.\r\n\r\nAt this stage I'm thinking of another approach : \r\n1. document that `Projection`'s getters only support OpenGL-style matrices\r\n2. provide a way to transform back any matrix to its OpenGL form (i.e. the inverse of `set_depth_correction`)\r\n3. help users to figure out the form of the matrix when they access it (e.g. in the Compositor's callbacks) as it differs across renderers. They can then apply the right inverse transform before using the getters.\r\n\r\nOf course this is under the assumption that we do not want to revert #100209, which is also an option although it is mathematically accurate (only more restrictive in terms of assumptions, which allows aggressive simplification).\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108250/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108250/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}